Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,We've been building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Curify for over a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:05.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,and along the way, our vision
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,has become much clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,It all starts with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:09.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,the production AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,turning repetitive visual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,work into scalable,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,reliable workflows for studio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,retouching, product images,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,merchandise, and et cetera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,But production is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,only the first layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:25.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,The work should
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:27.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,become reusable intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,a design system personalized
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:31.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,to your organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:33.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,assets that can be reused,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:35.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,and inspirations can be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:36.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,tracked through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,And those real production
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,challenges drive our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:42.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,frontier research.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:44.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Experiments with design agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:47.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,evaluation, multimodal search,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,and new interfaces,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:50.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,including our work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,in sign languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,Together, this is how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:56.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,we think about Curify:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:57.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,production for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:01:00.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,intelligence that compounds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,over time, and research
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,that shapes what comes next.
